ge, and he has out-raised Jolly, though Jolly has kept pace with a competitive $11.6 million haul. Most expert raters call the race Lean Republican, and prediction markets give Donalds roughly a three-in-four chance.\n\nLate polling suggests a closer contest than the fundamentals imply, with one final survey showing Donalds ahead by only two points conditional on Republican turnout. Jolly is campaigning aggressively in the Panhandle and among independents, and some reporting questions Donalds' grip on Latino voters. The forecast lands on a modest Republican lead of about four to five points, with meaningful uncertainty given thin and mixed polling.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1709, "margin": -5.38}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2654, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.2923, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2636, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1983, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.2414, "margin": -3.8}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.2597, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.2217, "margin": -4.8}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.2584, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.252, "margin": -4.3}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.2745, "margin": -3.8}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.2552, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.2498, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.2281, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.2329, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.2195, "margin": -4.2}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.2688, "margin": -3.2}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.2284, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.224, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.2571, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.2372, "margin": -4.3}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.2555, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.2213, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-1